  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 13920,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What was your launch experience like?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 19040,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Our launch experience was phenomenal. I I don't \nthink we have the the words in the English  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 23680,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "language to describe space flight and what it \nfeels like. Um, you know, it literally felt  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 28000,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like we were being slingshotted off the earth. \nUm, you know, you've got millions of pounds of  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 32240,
    "dDurationMs": 6080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "thrust immediately. Um, and we were constantly \nunder G and then I like to say it's kind of like  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 38320,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " a cartoon, right, where you're you're being \npushed back into your seat, being accelerated,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 42560,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then when the engine cuts off, it's like dad \nslammed on the brakes and all the kids are on  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 46400,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the windshield. And then we went right back into \nthe seats again and built up the G's. Um, and you  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 51120,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "know, in a matter of 9 minutes, we were in orbit \nin lower Earth orbit. So uh it is a core memory  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 55920,
    "dDurationMs": 6720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that I will never forget. Yeah, since that was \nuh my second flight, I had more kind of room in  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 62640,
    "dDurationMs": 6880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "my mind to think about my surroundings. So I was \nactually kind of a little bit nervous compared to my  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 69520,
    "dDurationMs": 6480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "first flight just before the launch countdown. But \nas soon as the engine light up, everybody just got  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 76000,
    "dDurationMs": 11120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "excited. We were like woo. Let's go. What are the next items \non your space exploration bucket list? Oh, that's  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 87120,
    "dDurationMs": 7520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a good question. So, the first thing I'd like to \ndo is uh work as a flight controller again because  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 94640,
    "dDurationMs": 7040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "uh now I have a second space flight experience. \nSo, it's my kind of responsibility to share my  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 101680,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "experiences with my colleagues on the ground. So \nthat's my next step and hopefully I can get on  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 109680,
    "dDurationMs": 9520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the next - a future Artemis mission as well as an \nactive astronaut. Space bucket list. This one is  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 119200,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "uh it's a great question. Similar to Tak,\nyou know I think I feel a great sense of duty to  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 124320,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "bring our experience back to the ground and help \nthe the people on board right now. you know,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 128160,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we have people on board the ISS working and \nliving 24 hours a day, and so it's on us to  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 133120,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "bring our experience and help the ground team \nsupport them as best as we can. Um, would love  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 137360,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to go back to space in any capacity that NASA will \nlet me. So, uh, you know, whether that's back to  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 142000,
