    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the space station or onto the Moon with Artemis. \nUm, hopefully I can stay healthy enough and, uh,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 147200,
    "dDurationMs": 8080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and eventually get back out there. What was your \nfavorite science experiment to work on? Favorite  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 155280,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "science experiment is so tough to decide. Um we \nworked on a lot of different science while we were  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 159440,
    "dDurationMs": 5680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "up there. Um you know I did more the majority \nof the Ring Sheared Drop experiment. So looking  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 165120,
    "dDurationMs": 6240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at protein crystals and how they shear at the \nwater interface uh and really watching that with  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 171360,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "uh detailed cameras and changing out those samples \nand allowing them to build computer models of how  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 177360,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that works so that we can inform pharmaceutical \nmanufacturing uh and those pharmaceuticals will  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 182960,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "help you know with Parkinson's and cancer and \nAlzheimer's. So I think uh you know we have a  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 187520,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "very small portion of the science on station. \nIt's you know an hour a day maybe uh but it's  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 192480,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "somebody's life work that you're working on um \nand then it's something that can help further  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 196720,
    "dDurationMs": 7680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "humanity and help those in need. Since I majored \nmaterial science in my university my favorite  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 204400,
    "dDurationMs": 6960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "experiment is Electrostatic Levitation Furnace. \nSo instead of building a harness with metal,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 211360,
    "dDurationMs": 8080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we use a electrical static force to levitate our \nmetal samples so that we can get a precise data  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 219440,
    "dDurationMs": 6880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "under the high temperature and we can utilize \nthat kind of data to develop new material on  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 226320,
    "dDurationMs": 5920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the ground. So that's a cool experience. Tak, \nwhat was it like returning to the space station  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 232240,
    "dDurationMs": 5840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and how has it changed since your first mission? \nYeah, it's like uh going back home. you are going  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 238080,
    "dDurationMs": 9360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "back your second home. So as soon as I got there \nuh it took me much less days uh to get readapted  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 247440,
    "dDurationMs": 8080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the microgravity compared to my first space \nflight. So which was good. We have now so good  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 255520,
    "dDurationMs": 8720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like internet connectivity while we were in the \nthe station. So, I feel the space station "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 264240,
    "dDurationMs": 8080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "program is getting still like bigger and bigger. \nNichole, how did your career as a division one  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 272320,
    "dDurationMs": 7200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "volleyball player at the US Air Force Academy \nhelp prepare you for a career as an astronaut?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 279520,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh man, you know, I love to talk about, \nespecially with little kids, you know,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 284000,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hard work and teamwork are the two things \nthat will get you wherever you want to go. Um,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 287520,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and so being on a team like the volleyball team \nat the Air Force Academy really taught me how to  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 291680,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "take care of other people, especially in high \npressure situations. Um, and how to care about  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 296640,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "those around you even when you're struggling \nor when you need someone on for the day. Um,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 302000,
    "dDurationMs": 5760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and so I think just generally learning how \nto live and work on a team is so important  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 307760,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it will get you anywhere you want, but it \ndefinitely benefits you when you're, you know,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 311680,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in space and you're on the space station with six \nother humans for, you know, five or six months.  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 316080,
    "dDurationMs": 4411,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It just allows you to be more aware of your \nyour teammates and take better care of people."
    } ]
  } ]
